nventory management, distribution, and collection of equipment and uniforms Works with the Athletic Department in all sport promotions, fundraising, and recruitment efforts Assist with USM Athletic Department game and event management Available for teaching duties up to 4 hours per academic year Perform other job-related duties as assigned REQUIREMENTS : Bachelor’s Degree, Masters preferred 2-3 years related experience Able to work nights and weekends with capabilities to travel Ability to lift 30 to 50 lbs. and sit or stand for long periods of time. Must be twenty-one (21) years or older and be able to successfully complete and maintain the approved driver certification     TO APPLY:  Submit a cover letter, resume and contact information for at least three current professional references.  Saint Mary is an Equal Opportunity Employer.  Questions: email human resources at hr@stmary.edu",
