anizational skills with the ability to manage multiple projects and meet deadline Must be self-starter – able to work with minimal direction/supervision and should possess and demonstrate initiative Must be highly motivated, energetic, and a resourceful problem solver Excellent customer service skills Intermediate level experience with MS Word, Excel and PowerPoint Must be able to successfully pass required background screening as appropriate Affinity with the overall mission of the University of Saint Mary   TO APPLY:  Submit a cover letter, resume and contact information for at least three current professional references.  Saint Mary is an Equal Opportunity Employer.  Questions: email human resources at  hr@stmary.edu",
