rs or above in counseling, sociology, or social work. Affinity with the Mission of the University of Saint Mary.   TO APPLY:  Submit a cover letter, resume and contact information for at least three current professional references.  Saint Mary is an Equal Opportunity Employer.  Questions: email human resources at  hr@stmary.edu",
